  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Demonic Power Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/Estarossa-Mael_about_to_absorb_Truth_commandment.png/revision/latest?cb=20180914193006\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Estarossa-Mael about to absorb Truth commandment\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/Estarossa-Mael_about_to_absorb_Truth_commandment.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180914193006\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/Estarossa-Mael_about_to_absorb_Truth_commandment.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180914193006 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d8/Estarossa-Mael_about_to_absorb_Truth_commandment.png/revision/latest?cb=20180914193006 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Estarossa-Mael about to absorb Truth commandment\" width=\"270\" height=\"269\" data-image-key=\"Estarossa-Mael_about_to_absorb_Truth_commandment.png\" data-image-name=\"Estarossa-Mael about to absorb Truth commandment.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Mael (Nanatsu no Taizai) absorbs the demonic Commandment, Truth.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb/steal the power of demons.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb/steal the powers of demons</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Demon_Manipulation\" title=\"Demon Manipulation\">Demon Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Divine Power Absorption\">Divine Power Absorption</a>. Not be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Demonic_Power_Replication\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Demonic Power Replication\">Demonic Power Replication</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDemonic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Demon/Diabolical Power Absorption/Theft</li>\n<li>Hellish/Satanic Power Absorption/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDemonic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb and/or steal the powers of demons, rendering them powerless and vulnerable, potentially allowing the user to become demonic themselves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDemonic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Demon_Physiology\" title=\"Demon Physiology\">Demon Physiology</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Demon_Physiology/Transcendent\" title=\"Demon Physiology/Transcendent\">Transcendent Demon Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Demonic_Power_Negation\" title=\"Demonic Power Negation\">Demonic Power Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Demon_Slayer\" title=\"Archetype:Demon Slayer\">Archetype:Demon Slayer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Mixture\" title=\"Power Mixture\">Power Mixture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Replication\" title=\"Superpower Replication\">Superpower Replication</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDemonic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Demonic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Demonic Energy Absorption\">Demonic Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Fallen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Archetype:Fallen\">Archetype:Fallen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">Superpower Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDemonic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May overload with stolen powers.\n<ul><li>The user’s body may become unstable as a result.</li>\n<li>If killed, the powers may return to their previous owners.</li></ul></li>\n<li>May only be able to absorb powers of demons, not energies.</li>\n<li>Cannot steal the powers of an omnipotent demon.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDemonic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Shardbinders (<i>Bloodstained: Ritual of The Night</i>)\n<ul><li>Dominique</li>\n<li>Gebel</li>\n<li>Miriam</li></ul></li>\n<li>Soma Cruz (<i>Castlevania</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://charmed.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:charmed:Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> Users (<i>Charmed</i>)</li>\n<li>Stephen Strange (<i>Doctor Strange: The Sorcerer Supreme</i>); via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nanatsu-no-taizai.fandom.com/wiki/Mael\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nanatsu-no-taizai:Mael\">Mael</a> (<i>Nanatsu no Taizai</i>)</li>\n<li>Oh Kang Woo (<i>Player Who Returned 10,000 Years Later</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDemonic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://inuyasha.fandom.com/wiki/Tessaiga\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:inuyasha:Tessaiga\">Tessaiga</a> (<i>InuYasha</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDemonic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"6c89e11e9842cd617f8b3c2aa8f9a57a\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Oh_Kang_Woo_Player_Who_Returned_10-000_Years_Later-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:144px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Oh_Kang_Woo_Player_Who_Returned_10,000_Years_Later.png\" title=\"Oh Kang Woo Player Who Returned 10,000 Years Later.png (581 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:144px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/25/Oh_Kang_Woo_P